WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:03.810
<b>Episode 3: School Festival with Him</b>

00:18.350 --> 00:20.090
<i>Looks: A+!</i>

00:18.870 --> 00:20.580
<b>Looks A+</b>

00:21.720 --> 00:23.580
<i>Body: A+!</i>

00:22.120 --> 00:23.580
<b>Body A+</b>

00:25.590 --> 00:27.520
<i>Personality: A+!</i>

00:26.630 --> 00:27.840
<b>Personality A+
(On the outside)</b>

00:28.380 --> 00:32.340
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

00:32.340 --> 00:36.090
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

00:36.090 --> 00:38.000
<i>It's been a year since I moved to Tokyo.</i>

00:42.350 --> 00:45.720
<i>And in my high school life, 
it's me for the win!</i>

01:13.460 --> 01:13.880
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:13.460 --> 01:13.880
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:14.880
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:14.880
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:14.880
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:14.880
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

02:10.310 --> 02:16.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:10.310 --> 02:16.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:22.070 --> 02:24.160
<b></b>In

02:24.160 --> 02:25.620
<b>Tsubomi</b>

02:25.620 --> 02:29.960
<b>Fes Committee Selection
(Marimo Fes.)</b>

02:25.620 --> 02:29.960
<b>Tsubomi Haruno</b>

02:26.160 --> 02:29.260
We have our first rep, 
and it's Tsubomi Haruno!

02:35.170 --> 02:36.630
<b>Mona</b>

02:35.170 --> 02:36.630
<b>Tsubomi</b>

02:36.630 --> 02:40.100
And our second rep is Mona Kawai!

02:42.410 --> 02:45.560
G-Glad to be working with you, Mona-chan.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.980
<b>Mona    Tsubomi</b>

02:46.340 --> 02:47.630
Same here.

02:50.440 --> 02:55.940
<b>Marimo</b>

02:50.440 --> 02:55.940
<b>Fes.</b>

02:50.440 --> 02:55.940
<b>Sep 29 (Fri)-Sep 30 (Sat)</b>

02:56.790 --> 02:58.900
This is kinda hard.

02:59.400 --> 03:02.450
I'm not good with precision work.

03:02.450 --> 03:04.830
Will you stop eating for one second?

03:05.160 --> 03:08.450
Like they say, you can't something-or-another 
on an empty stomach.

03:08.700 --> 03:11.210
Like I care! Yeesh!

03:11.950 --> 03:16.440
Hmm, that should be enough hot plates.

03:17.230 --> 03:21.220
Wonder how many more kettles 
we'll be needin' for hot water.

03:22.250 --> 03:25.540
<i>We're smack-bang in the 
middle of festival prep.</i>

03:25.950 --> 03:27.220
Mona-chan.

03:27.640 --> 03:30.810
You see, my older sister's in the theater club.

03:30.810 --> 03:32.700
A-And?

03:32.700 --> 03:35.980
<i>Haruno-san and I have been talking a lot more.</i>

03:35.980 --> 03:39.200
She said they could let us borrow 
some outfits for the festival.

03:39.200 --> 03:41.700
<i>While I'm not as wary of her as I used to be...</i>

03:42.020 --> 03:44.920
Wow, that'd really help!

03:50.190 --> 03:53.710
I hope you get to show off for Kuroiwa-kun.

03:53.710 --> 03:57.210
Th-That's not it! 
Don't you start with this again...

03:58.450 --> 04:00.030
See you after school.

04:02.700 --> 04:05.470
<i>Guh. What a freakin' pain.</i>

04:05.950 --> 04:09.890
I won't! As long as you 
keep your hands off my Medaka!

04:10.430 --> 04:12.310
<b>slam</b>

04:12.770 --> 04:15.330
<i>She totally has the wrong idea.</i>

04:15.330 --> 04:18.750
<i>She thinks I have a crush on Medaka!</i>

04:20.140 --> 04:25.450
<i>I'm just havin' a hard time gettin' him 
to fall for me, damn it!</i>

04:25.950 --> 04:29.640
<i>Why do I get the feeling I'm being glared at?</i>

04:30.450 --> 04:32.910
<b>Theater Club</b>

04:32.190 --> 04:35.000
Wow, there's all kinds here.

04:35.610 --> 04:38.540
We should have the class take a look 
before we do the survey.

04:38.540 --> 04:42.130
Why don't you try one of these on right now?

04:42.130 --> 04:43.110
Huh?

04:43.110 --> 04:45.050
Like this maid outfit...

04:45.050 --> 04:47.930
I think you'd look great in it!

04:48.210 --> 04:51.600
Oh, uh, maybe another time.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.970
Oh...

04:52.970 --> 04:55.870
Unrelated, but have you heard the story?

04:55.870 --> 04:56.900
What story?

04:56.900 --> 05:01.230
Our school has a really lovely legend 
related to the school festival.

05:01.540 --> 05:02.900
Legend...?

05:02.900 --> 05:06.780
I-It's about the passageway of destiny,

05:06.780 --> 05:09.100
AKA the Bridge of Love!

05:09.910 --> 05:12.150
Bridge of Love? What?

05:23.380 --> 05:25.670
Look, it's that passageway over there.

05:26.850 --> 05:29.700
For years in this school, it's been said that

05:29.700 --> 05:33.370
if you hold hands with your crush there 
during the school festival,

05:33.370 --> 05:36.000
the two of you will be bound forever in love!

05:36.830 --> 05:40.530
It kicks off a bunch of 
relationships every year.

05:40.530 --> 05:44.430
I know it's none of my business, 
but it still gets me all excited.

05:45.070 --> 05:48.750
Huh... The "Bridge of Love," eh?

05:49.650 --> 05:53.200
I'll pray that you and Kuroiwa-kun 
can hold hands there.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.870
Again, you've got it all wrong—

05:55.870 --> 05:57.060
Tsubomi?

05:58.200 --> 06:00.440
Can I talk to you about the outfits?

06:00.440 --> 06:01.900
Sure.

06:01.900 --> 06:05.370
Sorry, Mona-chan, this might take a while.

06:05.710 --> 06:07.000
So, what's up?

06:08.440 --> 06:12.250
If this keeps up, my rep as 
queen bee's gonna take a beatin'.

06:16.050 --> 06:18.860
<i>How do I set Haruno-san straight?</i>

06:18.860 --> 06:21.060
<i>There's only one way!</i>

06:21.460 --> 06:23.870
<i>And that's makin' Medaka fall for me ASAP!</i>

06:23.870 --> 06:26.490
<i>For which the school festival's 
a golden opportunity.</i>

06:28.130 --> 06:29.950
<i>Shoot him through the heart!</i>

06:29.950 --> 06:31.560
<i>The classic maid outfit!</i>

06:31.560 --> 06:33.470
Flavor, flavor, come here.

06:33.970 --> 06:34.990
<i>Next!</i>

06:34.990 --> 06:36.900
<i>A ghost's white robe!</i>

06:36.900 --> 06:39.080
Curse ye!

06:39.080 --> 06:39.970
<i>Next!</i>

06:39.970 --> 06:41.450
<i>Miniskirt cop!</i>

06:41.450 --> 06:43.090
Bam!

06:43.090 --> 06:44.110
<i>Next!</i>

06:44.110 --> 06:45.670
<i>Hottie butler!</i>

06:45.670 --> 06:48.100
Your wish is my command, milady.

06:48.100 --> 06:49.470
<i>Okay, maybe not.</i>

06:49.470 --> 06:53.390
What's next? I need somethin' 
that'll make Medaka's heart race!

07:02.650 --> 07:05.400
Yikes, this shows a lot of skin.

07:05.400 --> 07:08.150
Y-Yeah, maybe not.

07:08.550 --> 07:10.020
I should change.

07:15.490 --> 07:17.490
<i>Medaka?!</i>

07:17.490 --> 07:20.370
Wh-Why are you dressed like that?

07:20.370 --> 07:26.460
I-I just tried it on as part of 
my f-festival committee duties.

07:26.460 --> 07:28.380
<i>Wh-What a disaster!</i>

07:28.660 --> 07:33.010
I-I'm only here because the teacher 
asked me to deliver these papers.

07:33.710 --> 07:35.770
I'll leave in a sec.

07:35.770 --> 07:38.020
<i>What is </i>wrong<i> with Tokyo?!</i>

07:38.350 --> 07:41.060
Okay, I'll see you when you bring those back.

07:41.060 --> 07:43.520
Sure! Thanks, Onee-chan.

07:43.520 --> 07:46.500
<i>Oh, crap! If she comes in here now...</i>

07:46.500 --> 07:51.570
Mona-chan? You changed into that 
for some alone time with Kuroiwa-kun?!

07:51.570 --> 07:53.440
You really do like him!

07:53.440 --> 07:54.280
Eep!

07:56.370 --> 07:57.310
This way!

07:57.310 --> 07:57.870
Wha...

08:01.370 --> 08:02.870
I'm back.

08:10.660 --> 08:12.070
Mona-chan?

08:13.590 --> 08:15.550
Where'd she go?

08:16.640 --> 08:22.320
<i>I-I hid in the spur of the moment... 
Wh-What now?</i>

08:23.450 --> 08:25.320
<i>What now?!</i>

08:23.450 --> 08:25.320
<i>What now?!</i>

08:26.300 --> 08:29.220
Where'd all these papers come from?

08:30.280 --> 08:33.530
<i>We gotta hang out here 'til Haruno-san leaves.</i>

08:35.530 --> 08:40.560
<i>I... I'm stickin' to Medaka like glue here.</i>

08:40.560 --> 08:43.450
<i>I hope he doesn't feel my heartbeat.</i>

08:45.670 --> 08:49.460
<i>Heck, I'm even pressin' my boobs on him!</i>

08:50.790 --> 08:55.040
<i>I'm givin' too much away again!</i>

08:59.650 --> 09:03.380
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

09:10.620 --> 09:14.010
I am void.

09:14.010 --> 09:15.950
<i>His breath's tickling my ear!</i>

09:15.950 --> 09:18.820
I am void.

09:18.820 --> 09:21.870
<i>Th-This is bad news!</i>

09:25.500 --> 09:26.740
Tsubomi?

09:27.580 --> 09:29.630
Sorry, can you come with me again?

09:29.630 --> 09:30.460
Okay.

09:30.460 --> 09:32.560
Huh? Where's Kawai-san?

09:32.560 --> 09:33.580
I don't know.

09:33.580 --> 09:35.070
She went off somewhere.

09:35.070 --> 09:36.180
She did?

09:39.900 --> 09:42.550
Looks like she's gone, Kuroiwa-kun.

09:45.050 --> 09:48.510
<i>Phew! Close call!</i>

09:48.510 --> 09:50.860
<i>I even dragged Medaka into it!</i>

09:52.290 --> 09:57.330
<i>Huh? Wait, did I just put on 
the ultimate performance?</i>

09:57.330 --> 10:01.490
<i>Yeah, yeah! He spent minutes 
in the dark with me clinging to him!</i>

10:01.880 --> 10:03.990
<i>Surely that got his heart racing!</i>

10:16.510 --> 10:18.650
<i>Well, of course.</i>

10:18.650 --> 10:20.300
<i>Look at this raunchy outfit.</i>

10:20.300 --> 10:22.850
<i>I clearly crossed the line here.</i>

10:23.230 --> 10:26.720
Nothing cute about this, huh?

10:28.270 --> 10:29.390
<b>stifle</b>

10:29.390 --> 10:33.610
G-Gosh, what am I even saying?

10:33.610 --> 10:36.280
Forget you heard anything, Kuroiwa-kun!

10:42.110 --> 10:43.270
You look cute.

10:49.720 --> 10:52.500
Y-You might be showing 
a bit too much skin, though.

11:01.890 --> 11:03.800
<b>hngggh</b>

11:05.060 --> 11:10.680
A-Again, what am I gettin' charmed for?!

11:13.360 --> 11:16.790
<i>I... I... I went and told her she was cute!</i>

11:17.480 --> 11:19.890
<i>My heart still feels like it's gonna explode.</i>

11:19.890 --> 11:22.410
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit...</i>

11:22.680 --> 11:25.090
<i>Why'd I have to go and say that?</i>

11:25.090 --> 11:28.540
<i>I'm not supposed to get 
friendly with girls, remember?!</i>

11:28.830 --> 11:31.260
<i>Something's wrong with me.</i>

11:31.260 --> 11:34.540
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

11:34.540 --> 11:38.210
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:34.540 --> 11:38.210
<b>The Next Morning</b>

11:36.210 --> 11:38.210
Good morning, Mona-chan.

11:38.210 --> 11:39.910
Mornin'!

11:42.530 --> 11:44.550
<i>I-It's all good.</i>

11:44.550 --> 11:49.280
<i>Medaka called me cute. I know what I heard.</i>

11:49.680 --> 11:55.110
<i>Which means he finally 
bent the knee to the queen bee!</i>

11:59.590 --> 12:01.450
Good morning, Kuroiwa-kun!

12:02.790 --> 12:04.070
Morning.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.360
<i>But...</i>

12:08.790 --> 12:12.480
<i>But why?!</i>

12:15.620 --> 12:18.000
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:20.630 --> 12:23.010
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:23.010 --> 12:26.970
<b>Day of the School Festival</b>

12:25.930 --> 12:31.020
<b>20th Annual School Festival</b>

12:33.520 --> 12:36.400
<b>Bunny Cafe</b>

12:35.310 --> 12:37.520
<b>Bunny Cafe</b>

12:37.520 --> 12:39.820
T-To confirm your order,

12:39.820 --> 12:43.520
three bunny pancakes 
and three orange juices, right?

12:43.520 --> 12:45.710
Here's your cola.

12:45.710 --> 12:47.140
Welcome.

12:47.530 --> 12:49.140
Thanks a lot!

12:49.870 --> 12:54.460
Hello! Welcome to the Bunny Cafe!

12:54.460 --> 12:56.420
Cute!

12:56.420 --> 12:57.460
Whoa.

12:57.460 --> 13:01.460
<b>30 mins</b>

12:57.460 --> 13:01.460
Please line up here. We currently 
have a thirty-minute wait time.

13:01.460 --> 13:03.960
<i>Woo, rare photos!</i>

13:08.470 --> 13:11.970
Asahi, let's go check out some other places.

13:11.970 --> 13:15.000
Okay. But let's stay a little longer.

13:16.020 --> 13:19.440
He's in the kitchen, right? 
You won't see him out here.

13:24.620 --> 13:27.250
We're doing great, thanks to Mona-chan.

13:27.250 --> 13:29.740
Yeah, bless Mona-chan!

13:30.470 --> 13:32.690
Time to switch shifts!

13:32.690 --> 13:34.500
Good work. Take a break.

13:34.780 --> 13:36.080
Okay!

13:36.080 --> 13:37.710
Can I go on break too?

13:37.710 --> 13:39.650
You're still working for a while.

13:39.650 --> 13:41.290
You take a break too, Mona-chan!

13:41.570 --> 13:44.300
Okay! Sweet!

13:44.300 --> 13:46.050
<i>It's time.</i>

13:49.830 --> 13:53.310
Kuroiwa-kun, come take a break with me.

13:53.870 --> 13:56.520
I'm fine without one.

13:56.520 --> 13:59.480
What? Don't say that.

13:59.480 --> 14:02.020
You've been cooped up in here the whole time.

14:04.780 --> 14:08.160
You must be hungry. Let's have lunch together.

14:13.990 --> 14:15.870
Well, I just ate.

14:15.870 --> 14:19.200
Hey, Medaka! Don't eat the orders!

14:19.200 --> 14:20.190
Zowwy.

14:21.820 --> 14:25.010
<i>And here I thought I'd swayed him a little.</i>

14:25.740 --> 14:26.980
You look cute.

14:28.100 --> 14:31.640
<i>It feels like he's rejectin' me 
even more than before.</i>

14:31.640 --> 14:33.260
<i>He's not even lookin' at me anymore.</i>

14:33.810 --> 14:37.930
<i>I bet he's just feelin' embarrassed after 
what he said. Happens all the time.</i>

14:37.930 --> 14:39.350
<i>Am I wrong?</i>

14:39.780 --> 14:45.070
<i>Either way, today we have an event 
that puts all teens on cloud nine.</i>

14:45.070 --> 14:49.520
<i>I'm settlin' this war with Medaka 
before the festival is over!</i>

14:49.520 --> 14:51.690
<i>I-I sense danger.</i>

14:58.790 --> 15:00.100
Haruno-san?

15:00.100 --> 15:03.210
Kuroiwa-kun, if you want 
to keep working so badly,

15:03.210 --> 15:07.460
put that on and go advertise 
our cafe with Mona-chan!

15:07.460 --> 15:08.840
Advertise?

15:08.840 --> 15:13.780
As our committee rep, I'm asking you—
no, I'm <i>ordering</i> you!

15:14.450 --> 15:16.770
Huh? An order?

15:16.770 --> 15:19.520
<i>N-Nice assist!</i>

15:19.810 --> 15:21.650
Good luck, girl!

15:22.300 --> 15:25.440
<i>You've got that part wrong, though.</i>

15:25.440 --> 15:27.370
Let's go, Kuroiwa-kun.

15:27.370 --> 15:30.650
<i>Th-This is just another part of my training.</i>

15:35.080 --> 15:39.940
Void... Void... Void...

15:39.940 --> 15:42.800
<i>The other classes are all 
putting in a lot of effort, too.</i>

15:42.800 --> 15:45.960
<i>We should check out everything 
Medaka might be interested in.</i>

15:45.960 --> 15:49.970
<b>Haunted House</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:49.970
<b>doom</b>

15:49.970 --> 15:51.950
That's scary as heck!

15:52.300 --> 15:55.300
<i>There's such a thing as too much effort!</i>

15:55.300 --> 15:57.680
Let's head over there, Kuroiwa-kun...

16:04.560 --> 16:06.860
<i>A-Are you kiddin' me?</i>

16:06.860 --> 16:09.190
Y-You wanna go in?

16:09.490 --> 16:10.440
Huh?

16:11.080 --> 16:14.250
N-No, I don't really care.

16:14.250 --> 16:17.200
<i>He totally wants to check it out!</i>

16:17.200 --> 16:20.940
<i>Why'd it have to be 
the one thing I hate the most?!</i>

16:21.450 --> 16:24.270
<i>N-Nah, I'll be fine.</i>

16:24.270 --> 16:29.090
<i>It's just gonna be some flimsy crap made 
by school kids. Probably not that scary.</i>

16:29.790 --> 16:31.280
Okay, let's check it out!

16:38.600 --> 16:41.350
Curse you!

16:47.170 --> 16:49.340
<i>Nope! This is pretty friggin' scary!</i>

16:49.340 --> 16:51.830
<i>Who was that just now? 
I'll kick his ass later!</i>

16:52.540 --> 16:54.240
I just heard a scream.

16:54.240 --> 16:58.420
W-Wasn't me. One of the other guests, maybe?

16:58.420 --> 16:59.720
Y-Yeah?

17:00.840 --> 17:03.500
I-It's dark in here. Let's take it slow.

17:05.430 --> 17:07.230
M-Med...

17:07.230 --> 17:10.960
Wow. The chilly air in here's 
just like the real deal.

17:11.370 --> 17:12.920
"The real deal"?

17:12.920 --> 17:16.880
And these grave markers 
look great for cardboard.

17:16.880 --> 17:19.290
I can tell they did their research.

17:19.290 --> 17:22.330
<i>He's lovin' it! Way more than I thought!</i>

17:22.330 --> 17:24.590
Reminds me of back home.

17:31.300 --> 17:32.660
<i>Stuck on a gravepost?</i>

17:33.610 --> 17:37.360
<i>Gimme a break. I can't get it off.</i>

17:37.360 --> 17:40.240
K-Kuroiwa-kun, give me a sec...

17:40.520 --> 17:42.110
I see, I see.

17:43.240 --> 17:45.940
Hey, wait, don't go.

17:45.940 --> 17:47.960
Look at these details.

17:48.290 --> 17:49.290
Wait!

17:49.290 --> 17:51.110
Who could've made this?

17:51.110 --> 17:53.570
D-Don't leave me here...

17:53.570 --> 17:57.090
This sutra desk is a work of art!

17:57.370 --> 17:59.590
W-Wait for me.

18:03.100 --> 18:06.100
Please, wait for me!

18:06.380 --> 18:09.850
Whoa! Y... Your skirt!

18:09.850 --> 18:12.410
I'm scared!

18:14.340 --> 18:16.740
I saw nothing! I saw nothing, I swear!

18:20.620 --> 18:25.070
I hate haunted houses!

18:24.080 --> 18:26.750
<b>Bunny</b>

18:25.070 --> 18:26.750
Th-The gravepost!

18:26.750 --> 18:31.670
<b>Bunny Cafe</b>

18:36.360 --> 18:39.380
<i>I hope those two are hitting it off!</i>

18:40.220 --> 18:42.080
H-Haruno-san!

18:42.080 --> 18:43.880
This is all charred.

18:44.700 --> 18:48.350
<i>Guh, that was a disaster.</i>

18:48.610 --> 18:50.200
Sorry about that.

18:50.200 --> 18:52.650
Curse you! I'm so jealous...

18:52.650 --> 18:55.150
<i>I'll have more chances, though.</i>

18:55.580 --> 18:58.410
<i>And I'm done listenin' 
to what Medaka wants to do.</i>

18:58.410 --> 18:59.900
<i>From here on in,</i>

19:00.200 --> 19:03.600
<i>I'll be taking us on a heart-racing 
course of excitement!</i>

19:04.160 --> 19:09.160
<b>Crêpes</b>

19:05.740 --> 19:08.720
<i>First up, the tried-and-tested crêpes!</i>

19:09.160 --> 19:10.640
Here you are.

19:09.160 --> 19:14.920
<b>Bunny</b>

19:10.640 --> 19:11.640
Thanks!

19:11.640 --> 19:13.460
Two strawberry crêpes, please.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.210
Here's yours.

19:13.210 --> 19:14.920
Th-Thanks.

19:13.460 --> 19:14.540
Coming right up.

19:15.540 --> 19:17.300
Time to dig in.

19:21.300 --> 19:23.110
G-Got some on you.

19:23.110 --> 19:23.960
Huh?

19:23.960 --> 19:26.810
U-Uh, cream on your cheek.

19:26.810 --> 19:31.060
Oh, no! Get it for me!

19:33.980 --> 19:37.960
Ah, my crepe!

19:34.230 --> 19:40.490
<b>Crêpes</b>

19:38.710 --> 19:40.110
No...

19:42.340 --> 19:43.450
It's good.

19:44.130 --> 19:45.370
<i>Fine!</i>

19:45.630 --> 19:47.050
<i>Concert time!</i>

19:48.190 --> 19:51.370
Wow, this is hype!

19:51.910 --> 19:54.420
But I can't see.

19:54.420 --> 19:56.250
Everyone's so tall.

19:56.810 --> 19:59.090
Say, give me a ride on your shoulders.

20:02.090 --> 20:04.590
I-If you're fine with me, sure.

20:05.600 --> 20:08.350
Wow, this is hardcore.

20:08.850 --> 20:10.850
<b>Balloon Art</b>

20:11.270 --> 20:13.640
<i>How d'ya like balloon art, then?!</i>

20:15.260 --> 20:16.000
Smooch.

20:16.560 --> 20:19.240
Stole a kiss. Tee-hee!

20:19.690 --> 20:21.820
I should draw a face.

20:31.250 --> 20:33.960
<b>gloom</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:38.460
U-Unbelievable. Everything's goin' wrong.

20:39.980 --> 20:43.500
<i>I haven't been able to make 
Medaka's heart race at all.</i>

20:44.340 --> 20:47.150
<i>What do I do? What do I do?!</i>

20:50.100 --> 20:52.740
<i>The school festival closes at five!</i>

20:52.740 --> 20:54.470
<i>Little more than an hour left...</i>

20:56.250 --> 20:57.660
Where to next?

20:57.660 --> 20:58.900
Oh, I dunno...

20:58.900 --> 21:00.660
Let's go catch a movie sometime.

21:00.660 --> 21:01.330
Sounds good.

21:01.330 --> 21:03.420
I knew it'd look good on you.

21:03.420 --> 21:04.570
You mean it?

21:06.110 --> 21:09.840
<i>What's with all the couples here?</i>

21:11.280 --> 21:12.200
<i>Oh...</i>

21:13.000 --> 21:15.710
<i>Wait, is this the place?</i>

21:16.310 --> 21:20.140
If you hold hands with your crush there 
during the school festival,

21:20.140 --> 21:22.840
the two of you will be bound forever in love!

21:22.840 --> 21:26.510
It kicks off a bunch of 
relationships every year.

21:30.040 --> 21:32.570
<i>Is this the Bridge of Love?</i>

21:40.270 --> 21:41.270
Hup!

21:43.280 --> 21:46.700
Damn, it's all teary-faced.

21:46.700 --> 21:48.490
And charred.

21:48.760 --> 21:50.600
You got the order of steps wrong!

21:50.600 --> 21:53.120
We'll handle the decorating!

21:53.120 --> 21:55.240
Hurry up and make another.

21:55.240 --> 22:00.550
Forget this! Someone bring Medaka back!

22:00.550 --> 22:02.630
I need to go to club.

22:03.590 --> 22:04.260
Oh.

22:04.260 --> 22:06.200
The invitational?

22:06.200 --> 22:10.850
Too bad you couldn't see him 
after coming here, huh?

22:12.710 --> 22:13.620
Yeah...

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Episode 4





Legend with Him</b>

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:46.970 --> 23:49.780
Next time: "Legend with Him."
